cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite both the paper and this repository."
title: "Cynomolgus proteome half-life analysis pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis of protein half-life in the cynomolgus monkey proteome
  (n = 3,514), testing sequence-feature, paralogy and protein-complex predictors
  of turnover. Includes a NumPy-only statistical re-implementation, frozen
  snapshots of every external database dependency, an acceptance table, and an
  interactive Streamlit application.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Kosugi"
    given-names: "Youhei"
    affiliation: "Preclinical Biomarkers, Takeda Pharmaceutical Company Limited"
